{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月20日，隨着全球AI概念股遭遇大規模拋售，市場風險偏好進一步惡化，比特幣跌至近五個月低點，勢將連續第七周錄得下跌。截至北京時間發稿，比特幣下跌2.3%至61874.4美元，本周累計下跌4.1%，延續了自10月初以來的下跌趨勢。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587250.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.306599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_hash":"9cc7a0da2fb455486845eb63366c75b7216030201174a8b307e489a79b671f46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}